('applied-linux-a01-l1', 6, 1, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Inspect the configuration', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'A fictional API in /opt/training-api is configured for port 8080 while its runbook requests 8081. Locate both sources and establish the mismatch before editing.', '[{"id":"a01-1-task-1","title":"Find the application directory and configuration.","description":"Find the application directory and configuration.","hint":"For “find the application directory and configuration.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “find the application directory and configuration.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ls to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ls /opt/training-api"],"feedback":"Config and runbook paths are identified.","expectedOutcome":"Config and runbook paths are identified."},{"id":"a01-1-task-2","title":"Read the configured port and runbook endpoint.","description":"Read the configured port and runbook endpoint.","hint":"For “read the configured port and runbook endpoint.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “read the configured port and runbook endpoint.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use cat to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: cat /opt/training-api"],"feedback":"Both values are supported by file evidence.","expectedOutcome":"Both values are supported by file evidence."},{"id":"a01-1-task-3","title":"Record the observed mismatch with both file paths.","description":"Record the 