('applied-linux-a01-l2', 6, 2, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Make a controlled configuration change', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'A maintenance window authorizes changing only the training app port to 8081. Back up the original file, use the simulated editor, then validate syntax and value.', '[{"id":"a01-2-task-1","title":"Create a backup and compare its contents with the original.","description":"Create a backup and compare its contents with the original.","hint":"For “create a backup and compare its contents with the original.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “create a backup and compare its contents with the original.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use cp to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: cp SOURCE BACKUP"],"feedback":"Backup preserves original content.","expectedOutcome":"Backup preserves original content."},{"id":"a01-2-task-2","title":"Edit only the permitted port setting.","description":"Edit only the permitted port setting.","hint":"For “edit only the permitted port setting.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “edit only the permitted port setting.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use editor to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: editor set /the-config-from-this-scenario .KEY VALUE"],"feedback":"Only the authorized value changed.","expectedOutcome":"Only the authorized value changed."},{"id":"a01-2-task-3","title":"Validate JSON syntax and confirm port 8081.","description":"