('applied-linux-a01-l3', 6, 3, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Verify the application', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'The config now specifies 8081. Reload only the authorized lab service, test the endpoint, inspect fresh logs, and explain what the check proves.', '[{"id":"a01-3-task-1","title":"Reload the fictional service and inspect its status.","description":"Reload the fictional service and inspect its status.","hint":"For “reload the fictional service and inspect its status.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “reload the fictional service and inspect its status.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use systemctl to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: systemctl status SERVICE"],"feedback":"Reload is reflected in service state/logs.","expectedOutcome":"Reload is reflected in service state/logs."},{"id":"a01-3-task-2","title":"Request the configured health endpoint.","description":"Request the configured health endpoint.","hint":"For “request the configured health endpoint.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “request the configured health endpoint.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use curl to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: curl https://the-scenario-endpoint"],"feedback":"Port 8081 responds healthy.","expectedOutcome":"Port 8081 responds healthy."},{"id":"a01-3-task-3","title":"Hand over the change and cite endpoint and log evidence.","description":"Hand over the change and cite endpoint and 