('applied-linux-a02-l1', 7, 1, 'Users, groups, and permissions', 'blue', 'Grant private report access without widening the boundary.', 'Diagnose access', '8 min', 'Linux checks owner, group, then other permissions. Scoped sudo in this lab changes only fictional training files.', 'The reporting user cannot read /srv/reports/monthly.csv. Identify user groups and file owner, group, and mode before proposing a change.', '[{"id":"a02-1-task-1","title":"Inspect the current identity and groups.","description":"Inspect the current identity and groups.","hint":"For “inspect the current identity and groups.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “inspect the current identity and groups.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use whoami to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: whoami"],"feedback":"Identity and group evidence is captured.","expectedOutcome":"Identity and group evidence is captured."},{"id":"a02-1-task-2","title":"Read the report metadata.","description":"Read the report metadata.","hint":"For “read the report metadata.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “read the report metadata.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ls to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ls /srv/reports/monthly.csv."],"feedback":"File owner/group/mode are identified.","expectedOutcome":"File owner/group/mode are identified."},{"id":"a02-1-task-3","title":"Explain the denial using the observed permission bits.","description":"Explain the denial using the observed permission bits.","hint":"For “explain the denial using the observed permission bits.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints"