('applied-linux-a02-l2', 7, 2, 'Users, groups, and permissions', 'blue', 'Grant private report access without widening the boundary.', 'Grant scoped access', '8 min', 'Linux checks owner, group, then other permissions. Scoped sudo in this lab changes only fictional training files.', 'An authorized lab administrator may grant the report-reader group read access. Do not grant world access; chmod 777 is explicitly rejected.', '[{"id":"a02-2-task-1","title":"Use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.","description":"Use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.","hint":"For “use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use chgrp to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: chgrp GROUP REPORT_FILE"],"feedback":"Only the intended group gains access.","expectedOutcome":"Only the intended group gains access."},{"id":"a02-2-task-2","title":"Inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.","description":"Inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.","hint":"For “inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ls to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ls /the/path/from-this-scenario"],"feedback":"Metadata reflects the approved policy.","expectedOutcome":"Metadata reflects the approved policy."},{"id":"a02-2-task-3","title":"Verify unrelated users still lack read permission.","description":"Verify unrelated users still lack read permission.","hint":