('applied-linux-a04-l2', 9, 2, 'Networking, DNS, ports, and HTTPS', 'orange', 'Separate name resolution, routing, listening ports, and HTTP/TLS evidence.', 'Check the listening service', '8 min', 'DNS maps names to addresses; routes select next hops; sockets show listeners; HTTPS adds certificate and hostname checks. These checks are separate.', 'The host resolves correctly but the API is listening on 8443 while another virtual service occupies 443. Distinguish port selection from DNS and app health.', '[{"id":"a04-2-task-1","title":"Inspect listening training ports.","description":"Inspect listening training ports.","hint":"For “inspect listening training ports.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “inspect listening training ports.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ss to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ss -ltn"],"feedback":"Listening socket state is read.","expectedOutcome":"Listening socket state is read."},{"id":"a04-2-task-2","title":"Compare the app port with the requested address.","description":"Compare the app port with the requested address.","hint":"For “compare the app port with the requested address.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “compare the app port with the requested address.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use cat to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: cat /the/config-or-log-from-this-scenario"],"feedback":"Service and request ports are separated.","expectedOutcome":"Service and request ports are separated."},{"id":"a04-2-task-3","title":"Test the appropriate endpoint and classify the response.","description":"Test the appropriate endpoint and classify the response.","hint":"For “t