('applied-linux-a04-l3', 9, 3, 'Networking, DNS, ports, and HTTPS', 'orange', 'Separate name resolution, routing, listening ports, and HTTP/TLS evidence.', 'Investigate HTTPS or allowlisting', '8 min', 'DNS maps names to addresses; routes select next hops; sockets show listeners; HTTPS adds certificate and hostname checks. These checks are separate.', 'A WAF-style event shows a source address mismatch behind a proxy. Inspect certificate and forwarded-IP evidence; proxy handling is explicitly unconfirmed.', '[{"id":"a04-3-task-1","title":"Inspect certificate hostname, validity, and TLS termination evidence.","description":"Inspect certificate hostname, validity, and TLS termination evidence.","hint":"For “inspect certificate hostname, validity, and tls termination evidence.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “inspect certificate hostname, validity, and tls termination evidence.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ip addr to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ip addr"],"feedback":"Certificate evidence is recorded.","expectedOutcome":"Certificate evidence is recorded."},{"id":"a04-3-task-2","title":"Read the WAF event’s source and forwarded-IP fields.","description":"Read the WAF event’s source and forwarded-IP fields.","hint":"For “read the waf event’s source and forwarded-ip fields.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “read the waf event’s source and forwarded-ip fields.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use ip route to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: ip addr"],"feedback":"Proxy source and configured forwarding are compared.","expectedOutcome":"Proxy source and configured forwarding are compared."},{"id":"