('sre-operations-b02-l2', 17, 2, 'Alarms, escalation, and incident reporting', 'blue', 'Evaluate alarm state and create evidence-backed handovers.', 'Correlate alarms and service impact', '8 min', 'This lab uses CloudWatch-like alarm evaluation and separately labeled training status. Squadcast-style routing is fictional context, not a confirmed integration.', 'A composite rule and repeated notifications refer to a single service issue. Keep cloud alarm states separate from fictional Normal/Cautious/Serious labels.', '[{"id":"b02-2-task-1","title":"Inspect composite rule and service evidence.","description":"Inspect composite rule and service evidence.","hint":"For “inspect composite rule and service evidence.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “inspect composite rule and service evidence.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use alarm evaluator to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: alarm evaluator <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Alarm, notification, and incident are separated.","expectedOutcome":"Alarm, notification, and incident are separated."},{"id":"b02-2-task-2","title":"Group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.","description":"Group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.","hint":"For “group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use notification timeline to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: notification timeline <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Duplicate notices are not counted as sep