('sre-operations-b04-l2', 19, 2, 'Vulnerability findings and security events', 'orange', 'Separate raw security evidence from interpretation and confidence.', 'Understand a Wazuh-style event', '8 min', 'Security findings and event rules are fictional training records. An empty findings view does not establish scan coverage.', 'Follow a raw event through collection, decoder, matching rule, endpoint, severity, storage, and display.', '[{"id":"b04-2-task-1","title":"Read the raw event and extracted fields.","description":"Read the raw event and extracted fields.","hint":"For “read the raw event and extracted fields.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “read the raw event and extracted fields.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use findings dashboard to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: findings dashboard <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Raw fields are preserved.","expectedOutcome":"Raw fields are preserved."},{"id":"b04-2-task-2","title":"Identify decoder/rule and endpoint/time.","description":"Identify decoder/rule and endpoint/time.","hint":"For “identify decoder/rule and endpoint/time.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “identify decoder/rule and endpoint/time.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use event viewer to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: event viewer <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Rule and decoder are correctly linked.","expectedOutcome":"Rule and decoder are correctly linked."},{"id":"b04-2-task-3","title":"Separate raw facts from rule-assigned interpretation.","description":"Separate raw facts from rule-assigned interpretation.","hint":"For “separate raw fac