('sre-operations-b04-l3', 19, 3, 'Vulnerability findings and security events', 'orange', 'Separate raw security evidence from interpretation and confidence.', 'Investigate suspicious sign-ins', '8 min', 'Security findings and event rules are fictional training records. An empty findings view does not establish scan coverage.', 'Group supplied events by user/source/endpoint and compare later success with authorized support records. Similar-looking events may be unrelated.', '[{"id":"b04-3-task-1","title":"Filter the supplied time window.","description":"Filter the supplied time window.","hint":"For “filter the supplied time window.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “filter the supplied time window.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use findings dashboard to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: findings dashboard <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Time filter is correct.","expectedOutcome":"Time filter is correct."},{"id":"b04-3-task-2","title":"Group failures and inspect later successful logins.","description":"Group failures and inspect later successful logins.","hint":"For “group failures and inspect later successful logins.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","hints":["For “group failures and inspect later successful logins.,” identify the source, time window, and result you need to observe before changing anything.","Use event viewer to inspect the relevant scenario state and collect evidence for this task.","Example: event viewer <the resource named in this scenario>"],"feedback":"Events are grouped with source context.","expectedOutcome":"Events are grouped with source context."},{"id":"b04-3-task-3","title":"Submit confidence, evidence, and next action without unsupported compromise claims.","description":"Su